# Baseline .gitignore template for ai-sandbox-v2 worktrees (v2.3 PRD).
#
# Copied verbatim into each new `git worktree add` checkout by
# `src/deterministic/build-target-resolver.ts`. The ai-sandbox-v2 repo
# itself ships a near-identical .gitignore on the init commit; this file
# is the authoritative source for updates so they propagate to all new
# worktrees without touching the existing repo's history.
#
# Per PRD decision 2:
#   "Maintain a baseline template in
#    `continuous-agent/workspace-instructions/gitignore-template`. The
#    agent copies this into new worktrees."

